l they rot after a hundred days.”。\n第二步“2. 煮楻足火”描绘巨大的木甑中蒸煮原料，工匠正添柴加火，配文“煮楻足火：入楻桶蒸煮，去其杂质，存其纤维。”及“Boiling & Washing: Steam and boil in a large barrel to remove impurities and retain fibers.”。\n第三步“3. 荡料入帘”呈现一位工匠站在纸槽旁，双手持竹帘在水中轻轻荡动，配文“荡料入帘：持竹帘入槽，荡起浆液，滤水成膜。”及“Scooping & Forming: Hold the bamboo screen to scoop the pulp, filtering water to form a wet sheet.”。\n第四步“4. 覆帘压纸”展示工匠将湿纸页堆叠整齐，并用重物压榨挤出水分，配文“覆帘压纸：覆帘落纸，重压去水，始成湿纸。”及“Pressing: Stack the wet sheets and press hard to remove excess water.”。\n第五步“5. 透火焙干”描绘工匠将湿纸逐张贴在火墙上烘干，配文“透火焙干：贴壁烘干，揭纸成册，光洁如玉。”及“Drying: Paste the sheets on a heated wall to dry, then peel off the finished paper.”。\n画面底部中央位置，出现一个经典的1920年代中国黑白动画风格的“铁扇公主”小人作为视觉元素，该小人具有夸张的黑色剪影造型，头部呈方形印章状，四肢细长且富有弹性，呈现出手捧纸张、仰头惊叹的姿态，为画面增添了趣味性与复古美术片氛围。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Prompt", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [413.76739501953125, 727.0858154296875], "pos": [-282.2552185058594, 342.7514953613281], "id": 13, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.9.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [2344.7048543294272, 284.8167080349392], "scale": 0.45}}, "groups": [{"color": "#88A", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Ernie-Image-Turbo-4steps", "bounding": [588.8450317382812, 141.40785217285156, 996.4918823242188, 520.5733032226562]}], "links": [[1, 3, 0, 4, 0, "CLIP"], [2, 4, 0, 5, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [3, 7, 0, 6, 0, "LATENT"], [4, 2, 0, 6, 1, "VAE"], [5, 1, 0, 7, 0, "MODEL"], [6, 4, 0, 7, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [7, 5, 0, 7, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [8, 6, 0, 8, 0, "IMAGE"], [9, 6, 0, 9, 0, "IMAGE"], [10, 